# GummyGum Hub
# Base URL of the GummyGum backend, used to verify launch tokens and report results
VITE_GUMMYGUM_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Firebase config for this app lives directly in src/firebase.config.ts, not
# env vars — a Firebase web config is safe to expose client-side (Firebase's
# own security rules are the real boundary), so there's nothing to add here.
